usage: disastertrace-auto [-h] {build,run,score,report} ...

Automatically scored offline DisasterTrace first work package

positional arguments:
  {build,run,score,report}
    build               Verify source snapshots and construct public/private
                        datasets
    run                 Run diagnostic fixtures or consume externally supplied
                        responses
    score               Independently validate and score a saved run
    report              Write a report with source coverage and diagnostic
                        limitations

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
